    "title": "When Will 'The Chosen' Season 6 Be Released?",
    "text": "Published June 30, 2025, 3:00 p.m. ET The Chosen: Last Supper Trailer0 seconds of 2 minutes, 38 secondsVolume 0% That’s a wrap on the fifth season of The Chosen. The final three episodes of Dallas Jenkins’ beloved historical drama about the life of Jesus recently dropped on Prime Video. But what does the future hold for the popular franchise? Thankfully, we already have the answer. The series will consist of two more seasons, with the Season 6 finale and Season 7 premiere being released theatrically as standalone films before finding their way to Prime Video. Unfortunately, that’s not happening in the near future, with the Season 6 finale scheduled to debut in theaters on March 12, 2027. So… um… time to rewatch Seasons 1-4, I guess! When exactly can you expect The Chosen Season 6 to find its way to Prime Video? Here’s everything we know. How Many Episodes Are There of The Chosen Season 5? Visit Advertiser websiteGO TO PAGESeason 5 consists of eight episodes. The final three episodes of The Chosen debuted Sunday, June 29 on Amazon. When Will The Chosen Season 6 Be Released? The Chosen will not only be back for Seasons 6 and 7, but the sixth season began shooting in April 2025. It was previously announced that the Season 6 finale and Season 7 premiere of the popular franchise will be released theatrically as standalone films before finding their way to Prime Video. Deadline reports that the sixth season finale of The Chosen debuts in theaters on March 12, 2027. The theatrical release will be preceded by Season 6 streaming on Prime Video and followed by the Season 7 premiere hitting the big screen on March 31, 2028. Season 7 will eventually find its way to Prime Video following the theatrical run of the premiere. No official streaming release date has been announced, but based on the Season 6 finale’s theatrical release date, we expect the sixth season of The Chosen to premiere in late 2026 or early 2027 on Prime Video. Where To Watch The Chosen Season 5 Online: All five seasons of The Chosen are currently streaming on Prime Video. Per Forbes, the fifth season will begin streaming for free on The Chosen app/website on Saturday, September 13, 2025. Amazon Prime is available for $14.99/month or $139/year, with a standalone Prime Video membership also an option for $8.99/month. An ad-free version is available for an additional $2.99/month. Amazon offers a discounted student option for $7.49/month or $69/year, and EBT, Medicaid, SNAP, and other select government assistance recipients can qualify for a reduced $6.99/month membership. Does Prime Video Offer A Free Trial? Yes! You can sample the service by taking advantage of Prime Video’s 30-day free trial. Seasons 1-5 of The Chosen are now streaming on Prime Video. Tags Prime Video religion The Chosen",
